== Effects ==
* Grants a [[shield]] which lasts for {{dlc|nr}} 30 / {{dlc|r}} 20 seconds.

== Notes ==
* Subsequent uses of '''Algiz''' are additive: if it's used while the shield effect is already active, it will add to the duration of the shield effect.

== Strategy ==
* The invulnerability effect negates all forms of damage, including health loss from {{M|Blood Donation Machine}}s and {{M|Devil Beggar}}s. They can be used for free for the duration of the effect.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|nr}}: Doubles the duration of the shield, making it last a full minute.
* {{i|Book of Shadows}}: The shield effects also stack.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|r}}: No effect.

